# Saved calls, judge labels and voice transcripts ARE committed (about 19 MB), so every result can be recomputed
# from a clean checkout without API keys. Only the voice audio (136 MB) stays out: nothing is recomputed from it,
# it's only played back in the local console.
evals/results/cache/voice/audio/

